Libzvbi_teletextdec AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────────
    -txt_page string     page numbers to decode, subtitle for subtitles, *
                         for all (default "*")
    -txt_default_region int default G0 character set used for decoding (from
                         -1 to 87) (default -1)
    -txt_chop_top int    discards the top teletext line (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 1)
    -txt_format int      format of the subtitles (bitmap or text or ass)
                         (from 0 to 2) (default bitmap)
                           values:
                             bitmap  0 .D...S.....
                             text    1 .D...S.....
                             ass     2 .D...S.....
    -txt_left int        x offset of generated bitmaps (from 0 to 65535)
                         (default 0)
    -txt_top int         y offset of generated bitmaps (from 0 to 65535)
                         (default 0)
    -txt_chop_spaces int chops leading and trailing spaces from text (from 0
                         to 1) (default 1)
    -txt_duration int    display duration of teletext pages in msecs (from
                         -1 to 8.64e+07) (default -1)
    -txt_transparent int force transparent background of the teletext (from
                         0 to 1) (default 0)
    -txt_opacity int     set opacity of the transparent background (from -1
                         to 255) (default -1)

AV1 decoder AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
