                         (default 1472)
    -reuse boolean       explicitly allow reusing UDP sockets (default auto)
    -reuse_socket boolean explicitly allow reusing UDP sockets (default
                         auto)
    -connect boolean     set if connect() should be called on socket
                         (default false)
    -fifo_size int       set the UDP receiving circular buffer size,
                         expressed as a number of packets with size of 188
                         bytes (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 28672)
    -overrun_nonfatal boolean survive in case of UDP receiving circular
                         buffer overrun (default false)
    -timeout int         set raise error timeout, in microseconds (only in
                         read mode) (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 0)
    -sources string      Source list
    -block string        Block list

