    -timeout int         set timeout of socket I/O operations (from -1 to
                         INT_MAX) (default -1)
    -private_key string  set path to private key

Zmq AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -pkt_size int        Maximum send/read packet size (from -1 to INT_MAX)
                         (default 131072)

IPFS Gateway AVOptions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -gateway string      The gateway to ask for IPFS data.

RTSP muxer AVOptions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -initial_pause boolean do not start playing the stream immediately
                         (default false)
    -rtsp_transport flags set RTSP transport protocols (default 0)
                           values:
                             udp            ED......... UDP
                             tcp            ED......... TCP
                             udp_multicast  .D......... UDP multicast
                             http           .D......... HTTP tunneling
                             https          .D......... HTTPS tunneling
    -rtsp_flags flags    set RTSP flags (default 0)
                           values:
                             filter_src  .D......... only receive packets
                                         from the negotiated peer IP
                             listen      .D......... wait for incoming
                                         connections
                             prefer_tcp  ED......... try RTP via TCP first,
                                         if available
                             satip_raw   .D......... export raw MPEG-TS
                                         stream instead of demuxing
    -allowed_media_types flags set media types to accept from the server
                         (default video+audio+data+subtitle)
                           values:
                             video     .D......... Video
                             audio     .D......... Audio
                             data      .D......... Data
                             subtitle  .D......... Subtitle
    -min_port int        set minimum local UDP port (from 0 to 65535)
                         (default 5000)
    -max_port int        set maximum local UDP port (from 0 to 65535)
                         (default 65000)
    -listen_timeout int  set maximum timeout (in seconds) to wait for
                         incoming connections (-1 is infinite, imply flag
                         listen) (from INT_MIN to INT_MAX) (default -1)
    -timeout int64       set timeout (in microseconds) of socket I/O
                         operations (from INT_MIN to I64_MAX) (default 0)
    -reorder_queue_size int set number of packets to buffer for handling of
                         reordered packets (from -1 to INT_MAX) (default -1)
    -buffer_size int     Underlying protocol send/receive buffer size (from
                         -1 to INT_MAX) (default -1)
    -user_agent string   override User-Agent header (default
                         "Lavf60.16.100")

