Hls demuxer AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -live_start_index int segment index to start live streams at (negative
                         values are from the end) (from INT_MIN to INT_MAX)
                         (default -3)
    -prefer_x_start boolean prefer to use #EXT-X-START if it's in playlist
                         instead of live_start_index (default false)
    -allowed_extensions string List of file extensions that hls is allowed
                         to access (default
                         "3gp,aac,avi,ac3,eac3,flac,mkv,m3u8,m4a,m4s,m4v,mpg
                         ,mov,mp2,mp3,mp4,mpeg,mpegts,ogg,ogv,oga,ts,vob,wav
                         ")
    -max_reload int      Maximum number of times a insufficient list is
                         attempted to be reloaded (from 0 to INT_MAX)
                         (default 3)
    -m3u8_hold_counters int The maximum number of times to load m3u8 when it
                         refreshes without new segments (from 0 to INT_MAX)
                         (default 1000)
    -http_persistent boolean Use persistent HTTP connections (default true)
    -http_multiple boolean Use multiple HTTP connections for fetching
                         segments (default auto)
    -http_seekable boolean Use HTTP partial requests, 0 = disable, 1 =
                         enable, -1 = auto (default auto)
    -seg_format_options dictionary Set options for segment demuxer
    -seg_max_retry int   Maximum number of times to reload a segment on
                         error. (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 0)

