Image2 demuxer AVOptions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -pattern_type int    set pattern type (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 4)
                           values:
                             glob_sequence  0 .D......... select
                                            glob/sequence pattern type
                             glob           1 .D......... select glob
                                            pattern type
                             sequence       2 .D......... select sequence
                                            pattern type
                             none           3 .D......... disable pattern
                                            matching
    -start_number int    set first number in the sequence (from INT_MIN to
                         INT_MAX) (default 0)
    -start_number_range int set range for looking at the first sequence
                         number (from 1 to INT_MAX) (default 5)
    -ts_from_file int    set frame timestamp from file's one (from 0 to 2)
                         (default none)
                           values:
                             none  0 .D......... none
                             sec   1 .D......... second precision
                             ns    2 .D......... nano second precision
    -export_path_metadata boolean enable metadata containing input path
                         information (default false)
    -framerate video_rate set the video framerate (default "25")
    -pixel_format string set video pixel format
    -video_size image_size set video size
    -loop boolean        force loop over input file sequence (default false)

