Mov,mp4,m4a,3gp,3g2,mj2 AVOptions ──────────────────────────────────────────
    -use_absolute_path boolean allow using absolute path when opening alias,
                         this is a possible security issue (default false)
    -seek_streams_individually boolean Seek each stream individually to the
                         closest point (default true)
    -ignore_editlist boolean Ignore the edit list atom. (default false)
    -advanced_editlist boolean Modify the AVIndex according to the
                         editlists. Use this option to decode in the order
                         specified by the edits. (default true)
    -ignore_chapters boolean (default false)
    -use_mfra_for int    use mfra for fragment timestamps (from -1 to 2)
                         (default auto)
                           values:
                             auto  -1 .D.V....... auto
                             dts   1 .D.V....... dts
                             pts   2 .D.V....... pts
    -use_tfdt boolean    use tfdt for fragment timestamps (default true)
    -export_all boolean  Export unrecognized metadata entries (default
                         false)
    -export_xmp boolean  Export full XMP metadata (default false)
    -activation_bytes binary Secret bytes for Audible AAX files
    -audible_key binary  AES-128 Key for Audible AAXC files
    -audible_iv binary   AES-128 IV for Audible AAXC files
    -audible_fixed_key binary Fixed key used for handling Audible AAX files
    -decryption_key binary The media decryption key (hex)
    -enable_drefs boolean Enable external track support. (default false)
    -max_stts_delta int  treat offsets above this value as invalid (from 0
                         to UINT32_MAX) (default 4294487295)
    -interleaved_read boolean Interleave packets from multiple tracks at
                         demuxer level (default true)

