V4L2 indev AVOptions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    -standard string     set TV standard, used only by analog frame grabber
    -channel int         set TV channel, used only by frame grabber (from -1
                         to INT_MAX) (default -1)
    -video_size image_size set frame size
    -pixel_format string set preferred pixel format
    -input_format string set preferred pixel format (for raw video) or codec
                         name
    -framerate string    set frame rate
    -list_formats int    list available formats and exit (from 0 to INT_MAX)
                         (default 0)
                           values:
                             all         3 .D......... show all available
                                         formats
                             raw         1 .D......... show only
                                         non-compressed formats
                             compressed  2 .D......... show only compressed
                                         formats
    -list_standards int  list supported standards and exit (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 0)
                           values:
                             all  1 .D......... show all supported standards
    -timestamps int      set type of timestamps for grabbed frames (from 0
                         to 2) (default default)
                           values:
                             default   0 .D......... use timestamps from the
                                       kernel
                             abs       1 .D......... use absolute timestamps
                                       (wall clock)
                             mono2abs  2 .D......... force conversion from
                                       monotonic to absolute timestamps
    -ts int              set type of timestamps for grabbed frames (from 0
                         to 2) (default default)
                           values:
                             default   0 .D......... use timestamps from the
                                       kernel
                             abs       1 .D......... use absolute timestamps
                                       (wall clock)
                             mono2abs  2 .D......... force conversion from
                                       monotonic to absolute timestamps
    -use_libv4l2 boolean use libv4l2 (v4l-utils) conversion functions
                         (default false)

