                         or hd720.
    -framerate string    (default "ntsc")
    -draw_mouse int      Draw the mouse pointer. (from 0 to 1) (default 1)
    -follow_mouse int    Move the grabbing region when the mouse pointer
                         reaches within specified amount of pixels to the
                         edge of region. (from -1 to INT_MAX) (default 0)
                           values:
                             centered  -1 .D......... Keep the mouse pointer
                                       at the center of grabbing region when
                                       following.
    -show_region int     Show the grabbing region. (from 0 to 1) (default 0)
    -region_border int   Set the region border thickness. (from 1 to 128)
                         (default 3)
