                         INT_MAX) (default 2)
    reset_count int      Recalculate the crop area after this many frames
                         (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 0)
    max_outliers int     Threshold count of outliers (from 0 to INT_MAX)
                         (default 0)
    mode int             set mode (from 0 to 1) (default black)
                           values:
                             black    0 ..FV....... detect black pixels
                                      surrounding the video
                             mvedges  1 ..FV....... detect motion and edged
                                      surrounding the video
    high float           Set high threshold for edge detection (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 0.0980392)
    low float            Set low threshold for edge detection (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 0.0588235)
    mv_threshold int     motion vector threshold when estimating video
                         window size (from 0 to 100) (default 8)

