Estdif AVOptions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    mode int             specify the mode (from 0 to 1) (default field)
                           values:
                             frame  0 ..FV.....T. send one frame for each
                                    frame
                             field  1 ..FV.....T. send one frame for each
                                    field
