Nnedi AVOptions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    weights string       set weights file (default "nnedi3_weights.bin")
    deint int            set which frames to deinterlace (from 0 to 1)
                         (default all)
                           values:
                             all         0 ..FV.....T. deinterlace all
                                         frames
                             interlaced  1 ..FV.....T. only deinterlace
                                         frames marked as interlaced
    field int            set mode of operation (from -2 to 3) (default a)
                           values:
                             af  -2 ..FV.....T. use frame flags, both fields
                             a   -1 ..FV.....T. use frame flags, single
                                 field
                             t   0 ..FV.....T. use top field only
                             b   1 ..FV.....T. use bottom field only
                             tf  2 ..FV.....T. use both fields, top first
                             bf  3 ..FV.....T. use both fields, bottom first
    planes int           set which planes to process (from 0 to 15) (default
                         7)
    nsize int            set size of local neighborhood around each pixel,
                         used by the predictor neural network (from 0 to 6)
                         (default s32x4)
                           values:
                             s8x6   0 ..FV.....T.
                             s16x6  1 ..FV.....T.
                             s32x6  2 ..FV.....T.
                             s48x6  3 ..FV.....T.
                             s8x4   4 ..FV.....T.
                             s16x4  5 ..FV.....T.
                             s32x4  6 ..FV.....T.
    nns int              set number of neurons in predictor neural network
                         (from 0 to 4) (default n32)
                           values:
                             n16   0 ..FV.....T.
                             n32   1 ..FV.....T.
                             n64   2 ..FV.....T.
                             n128  3 ..FV.....T.
                             n256  4 ..FV.....T.
    qual int             set quality (from 1 to 2) (default fast)
                           values:
                             fast  1 ..FV.....T.
                             slow  2 ..FV.....T.
    etype int            set which set of weights to use in the predictor
                         (from 0 to 1) (default a)
                           values:
                             a    0 ..FV.....T. weights trained to minimize
                                  absolute error
                             abs  0 ..FV.....T. weights trained to minimize
                                  absolute error
                             s    1 ..FV.....T. weights trained to minimize
                                  squared error
                             mse  1 ..FV.....T. weights trained to minimize
                                  squared error
    pscrn int            set prescreening (from 0 to 4) (default new)
                           values:
                             none      0 ..FV.....T.
                             original  1 ..FV.....T.
                             new       2 ..FV.....T.
                             new2      3 ..FV.....T.
                             new3      4 ..FV.....T.

