                         3)
                           values:
                             mono  2 ..FV.......
                             tb    0 ..FV.......
                             lr    1 ..FV.......
    ref_pad float        Expansion (padding) coefficient for each cube face
                         of the reference video (from 0 to 10) (default 0)
    main_pad float       Expansion (padding) coeffiecient for each cube face
                         of the main video (from 0 to 10) (default 0)
    use_tape int         Specifies if the tape based SSIM 360 algorithm must
                         be used independent of the input video types (from
                         0 to 1) (default 0)
    heatmap_str string   Heatmap data for view-based evaluation. For heatmap
                         file format, please refer to
                         EntSphericalVideoHeatmapData.
    default_heatmap_width int Default heatmap dimension. Will be used when
                         dimension is not specified in heatmap data. (from 1
                         to 4096) (default 32)
    default_heatmap_height int Default heatmap dimension. Will be used when
                         dimension is not specified in heatmap data. (from 1
                         to 4096) (default 16)

