Tpad AVOptions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    start int            set the number of frames to delay input (from 0 to
                         INT_MAX) (default 0)
    stop int             set the number of frames to add after input
                         finished (from -1 to INT_MAX) (default 0)
    start_mode int       set the mode of added frames to start (from 0 to 1)
                         (default add)
                           values:
                             add    0 ..FV....... add solid-color frames
                             clone  1 ..FV....... clone first/last frame
    stop_mode int        set the mode of added frames to end (from 0 to 1)
                         (default add)
                           values:
                             add    0 ..FV....... add solid-color frames
                             clone  1 ..FV....... clone first/last frame
    start_duration duration set the duration to delay input (default 0)
    stop_duration duration set the duration to pad input (default 0)
    color color          set the color of the added frames (default "black")

Transpose AVOptions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
