    interp int           set interpolation method (from 0 to 7) (default
                         line)
                           values:
                             near       0 ..FV....... nearest neighbour
                             nearest    0 ..FV....... nearest neighbour
                             line       1 ..FV....... bilinear interpolation
                             linear     1 ..FV....... bilinear interpolation
