                             gauss      6 ..FV....... gaussian interpolation
                             gaussian   6 ..FV....... gaussian interpolation
                             mitchell   7 ..FV....... mitchell interpolation
w int                    output width (from 0 to 32767) (default 0)
h int                    output height (from 0 to 32767) (default 0)
    in_stereo int        input stereo format (from 0 to 2) (default 2d)
                           values:
                             2d   0 ..FV....... 2d mono
                             sbs  1 ..FV....... side by side
                             tb   2 ..FV....... top bottom
    out_stereo int       output stereo format (from 0 to 2) (default 2d)
                           values:
                             2d   0 ..FV....... 2d mono
                             sbs  1 ..FV....... side by side
                             tb   2 ..FV....... top bottom
