Vibrance AVOptions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    intensity float      set the intensity value (from -2 to 2) (default 0)
    rbal float           set the red balance value (from -10 to 10) (default
                         1)
    gbal float           set the green balance value (from -10 to 10)
                         (default 1)
    bbal float           set the blue balance value (from -10 to 10)
                         (default 1)
    rlum float           set the red luma coefficient (from 0 to 1) (default
                         0.072186)
    glum float           set the green luma coefficient (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 0.715158)
    blum float           set the blue luma coefficient (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 0.212656)
