Vidstabdetect AVOptions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    result string        path to the file used to write the transforms
                         (default "transforms.trf")
    shakiness int        how shaky is the video and how quick is the camera?
                         1: little (fast)
                         10: very strong/quick (slow) (from 1 to 10)
                         (default 5)
    accuracy int         (>=shakiness)
                         1: low
                         15: high (slow) (from 1 to 15) (default 15)
    stepsize int         region around minimum is scanned with 1 pixel
                         resolution (from 1 to 32) (default 6)
    mincontrast double   below this contrast a field is discarded (0-1)
                         (from 0 to 1) (default 0.25)
    show int             0: draw nothing; 1,2: show fields and transforms
                         (from 0 to 2) (default 0)
    tripod int           virtual tripod mode (if >0): motion is compared to
                         a reference reference frame (frame # is the value)
                         (from 0 to INT_MAX) (default 0)

Vidstabtransform AVOptions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
    input string         set path to the file storing the transforms
                         (default "transforms.trf")
    smoothing int        set number of frames*2 + 1 used for lowpass
                         filtering (from 0 to 1000) (default 15)
    optalgo int          set camera path optimization algo (from 0 to 2)
                         (default opt)
                           values:
                             opt    0 ..FV....... global optimization
                             gauss  1 ..FV....... gaussian kernel
                             avg    2 ..FV....... simple averaging on motion
    maxshift int         set maximal number of pixels to translate image
                         (from -1 to 500) (default -1)
    maxangle double      set maximal angle in rad to rotate image (from -1
                         to 3.14) (default -1)
    crop int             set cropping mode (from 0 to 1) (default keep)
                           values:
                             keep   0 ..FV....... keep border
                             black  1 ..FV....... black border
    invert int           invert transforms (from 0 to 1) (default 0)
    relative int         consider transforms as relative (from 0 to 1)
                         (default 1)
    zoom double          set percentage to zoom (>0: zoom in, <0: zoom out
                         (from -100 to 100) (default 0)
    optzoom int          set optimal zoom (0: nothing,
                         1: optimal static zoom,
                         2: optimal dynamic zoom) (from 0 to 2) (default 1)
    zoomspeed double     for adative zoom: percent to zoom maximally each
                         frame (from 0 to 5) (default 0.25)
    interpol int         set type of interpolation (from 0 to 3) (default
                         bilinear)
                           values:
                             no        0 ..FV....... no interpolation
                             linear    1 ..FV....... linear (horizontal)
                             bilinear  2 ..FV....... bi-linear
                             bicubic   3 ..FV....... bi-cubic
    tripod boolean       enable virtual tripod mode (same as
                         relative=0:smoothing=0) (default false)
    debug boolean        enable debug mode and writer global motions
                         information to file (default false)

